#==============================================================================================
#
#   font_face_set - CSS::FontFaceSet: document.fonts, the set of a document's font faces and
#                   its loading status
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/FontFaceSet.cpp (lines 1-465) and the inline members of
#       FontFaceSet.h (lines 19-81): creation, the set entries (a JS::Set), add, delete and
#       clear, the event handler attributes, finding the matching font faces of a font
#       shorthand, load() and check(), the font load events and the loading status (pending on
#       the environment, switching to loading and loaded). The set entries and the ready promise
#       are JS objects: creating a FontFaceSet traps in JS::Set::create until phase 3.
#
#       Copyright (c) 2024, Andrew Kaster <akaster@serenityos.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2024, Jamie Mansfield <jmansfield@cadixdev.org>
#       Copyright (c) 2026, Sam Atkins <sam@ladybird.org>
#       SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
#
#==============================================================================================

